          <p class="layer-explanation">Labels are limited for readability. Point and route data are not sampled; overlapping points remain separate records. Credits join catalog-local name labels to records. Record links include source-listed relationships and editorial related-article cards, not necessarily body citations. Dashed routes show inferred matches. A comparison automatically shows its selected evidence and name endpoints. Routes do not establish influence or agreement.</p>
